  <Placemark>
    <name>Leysin: Les 3 Tours</name>
    <description><![CDATA[~1.5 km and ~450 m descent from beside the Tete d'Ai top station. The upper 1.1 km follows the connected OSM path to the official Les 3 Tours GPX start. The bike-park section then continues with tables and jumps, playful singletrack, wooden features and natural forest traverses. A few steps can surprise less experienced riders. <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.alpesvaudoises.ch/en/V546/leysin/les-3-tours">Alpes Vaudoises - Les 3 Tours</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/63407951">OpenStreetMap</a> (ODbL). Official GPX and OSM geometries joined and simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
