  <Placemark>
    <name>Leysin: Nerine</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.3 km, +16/-477 m. A fast, playful red run redesigned in 2024, combining flow, varied jumps and more technical forest sections. It includes an optional black line with a demanding double jump. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.alpesvaudoises.ch/en/V547/leysin/nerine">Alpes Vaudoises - Nerine</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Alpes Vaudoises, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
