  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Merbe Downhill</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.2 km, +17/-621 m. A first proper DH trail, smooth and accessible, built to help riders gain confidence on a route that brings together all the essentials of downhill riding. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764283">Crans-Montana - Merbe Downhill</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
