  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Cry d'Er Downhill</name>
    <description><![CDATA[3.1 km, +20/-766 m. A lively red trail for confident riders, with berms, small jumps and root sections, delivering just the right amount of adrenaline. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764303">Crans-Montana - Cry d'Er Downhill</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
