  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Briesses Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[5.7 km, +164/-164 m. This loop in the forest around Moubra is ideal for getting started with mountain biking on the peaceful trails of Crans-Montana. An ideal outing for families and beginners. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764076">Crans-Montana - Briesses Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
