  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Contrees Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[23.3 km, +938/-938 m. Scenic mountain bike route through the vineyards, villages and forests of the Noble et Louable Contree, with views of the Alps and the Rhone, ending in the peaceful setting of Lake Moubra. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764101">Crans-Montana - Contrees Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
