  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Coteaux Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[19.8 km, +857/-857 m. Discover an action-packed loop between forests, alpine villages and recreational areas. It offers superb views of the Alps and the Rhone valley, before returning to the shore of Lake Moubra. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764245">Crans-Montana - Coteaux Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
