  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Lacs Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[10.8 km, +424/-423 m. This short 11 km mountain bike loop is a great way to explore the Haut-Plateau, passing mountain lakes, forests and quiet local roads. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764255">Crans-Montana - Lacs Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
