  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Valais Alpine Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[39.5 km, +740/-1600 m. One of the most popular mountain-biking routes in Central Valais climbs from Crans-Montana up to Alp Merdechon. It continues across the Tieche and descends over varied, partly challenging trails to Leuk/Susten. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764266">Crans-Montana - Valais Alpine Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
