  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Flowtrail Crans-Montana - Sierre</name>
    <description><![CDATA[9.7 km, +69/-954 m. <p>Smooth and sustained descent from Crans-Montana to Sierre. A spectacular flowtrail combining speed, technicality, and open views over the Rhone valley.</p> <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764136">Crans-Montana - Flowtrail Crans-Montana - Sierre</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
