  <Placemark>
    <name>Charmey - Vounetse (Gruyère) [36 CHF / Magic Pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vounetse 1627 m - top of the Charmey gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>No purpose-built bike park - this is old-school alpine riding. From Vounetse you drop through open pasture on alp tracks, then into forest singletrack back to Charmey, with the Dents Vertes restaurant as the obvious mid-ride stop. Quiet, scenic, and a good option when the bike parks are heaving on a Saturday.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Gondola day ticket 36 CHF adult (25-63), 31 CHF for 16-24, free under 6. Free with the Magic Pass.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 May; closed from 2 November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h40</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.charmey.ch/en/">Charmey</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.206881,46.625967,0</coordinates></Point>
