  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Le Salève (above Geneva) [18 EUR return]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Salève 1100 m - top of the Veyrier cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Mountain biking is only allowed on the dedicated marked trails here - the Saleve is a nature-protection area and the rules are enforced, so stick to the signed descents towards Veyrier, Monnetier and Collonges-sous-Saleve. Short runs (roughly 600 m of vertical) but you can lap them cheaply and the trails stay ridable very late into autumn.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>13 EUR one way, 18 EUR return; bikes travel in the cabin at no extra charge. Under 5 minutes to 1100 m.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January with no seasonal closure (normally open year-round).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-18:30<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h25</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.telepherique-du-saleve.com/en/">Saleve cable car</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.193165,46.154468,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
