    <name>Les Haberes: La Darandel</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.8 km blue downhill trail with a more committed character, including tables, rollers, doubles, berms and a step-up. <i>Source: <a href="https://leshaberes.com/dh-la-darandel">Les Haberes official trail page</a>. Officially embedded OpenRunner GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
