  <Placemark>
    <name>Anzère - Pas de Maimbré [bikes ride free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pas-de-Maimbré 2362 m - top of the Anzère gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Phoenix Ride is a 1.5 km red downhill trail with about 380 m of descent from La Dent, reached from the gondola mid-station. Five official enduro routes add options from the easy, lift-assisted Gentiane Bike Light to the longer intermediate Arnica and Tulipe loops. High, open and dry: a good choice in a wet spell lower down.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Carrying a mountain bike on the gondola is free in summer, which makes this unusually good value; you only pay your own passenger ticket. Anzere is a Magic Pass resort.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h50</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.anzere.ch/en/P77519/mountain-bike">Anzere tourism</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.385609,46.314928,0</coordinates></Point>
