  <Placemark>
    <name>Anzere: Gentiane Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[13.6 km easy lift-assisted route, +236/-749 m. From the gondola mid-station it traverses the Tsalan, Duez and Serin pastures, continues towards Tseuzier, climbs briefly from Pra Combere and returns along the shared Bisse de Sion trail. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.anzere.ch/fr/experiences/activites-ete/velo/vtt/gentiane-bike/">Anzere Tourism</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Anzere Tourism, simplified to 15 m.</i>]]></description>
