  <Placemark>
    <name>Anzere: Tulipe Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[24.7 km intermediate loop, +894/-901 m. It crosses the mayens du Go and Combe d Arbaz, descends through Planege and the villages of Blignou, Botyre and Luc, then climbs back to Anzere on a forest road. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.anzere.ch/fr/experiences/activites-ete/velo/vtt/tulipe-bike/">Anzere Tourism</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Anzere Tourism, simplified to 15 m.</i>]]></description>
