    <name>Champery: Grand-Conche DH (red)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.5 km official bike-park trail. A rocky and technical opening below Pointe des Mossettes followed by shaped berms, faster flowing sections and jumps back toward Les Crosets. <i>Source and GPX: <a href="https://www.regiondentsdumidi.ch/en/6866780-dh-track-n04-red-grand-conche-63528/">Region Dents du Midi</a>.</i>]]></description>
