  <Placemark>
    <name>Champery: Sundance DH (red)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.1 km official bike-park trail. A long descent from Les Crosets toward Champery: jumps and berms up top, a steeper middle, then a fast finish with large river gaps. <i>Source and GPX: <a href="https://www.regiondentsdumidi.ch/en/6866861-dh-track-n06-red-sundance-63538/">Region Dents du Midi</a>.</i>]]></description>
