  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Chotatai</name>
    <description><![CDATA[4.8 km blue downhill trail. Flowing, easy trail below the La Tzoumaz gondola with a few red-level passages and several jumps, finishing near the Etablons junction. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/chotatai-la-tzoumaz-fr-2794065/">Verbier - Chotatai</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
