  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 08 - Ruinettes - Planards - Verbier</name>
    <description><![CDATA[12.1 km, +256/-930 m beginner enduro route. Verbier's most accessible enduro route and a gentle introduction to the discipline. It follows part of La Planie from Les Ruinettes, turns toward Les Planards, then returns to Verbier through Mayen de Bry and Carrefour. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-08-debutant-ruinettes-planards-verbier-verbier-fr-2794063/">Verbier - Enduro 08</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
