  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 12 - Gentianes - La Chaux</name>
    <description><![CDATA[7.1 km, +40/-702 m beginner enduro route. Beginner high-altitude route above 2,800 m through stark, lunar scenery. A mountain road and scenic trail pass below the Bec des Rosses, with the Cabane Mont Fort offering a natural break before the second half of the descent. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-12-debutant-gentianes-la-chaux-verbier-fr-2794019/">Verbier - Enduro 12</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
