  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 21 - Croix de Coeur - La Tzoumaz</name>
    <description><![CDATA[6.0 km, +2/-620 m beginner enduro route. Long, playful beginner singletrack from Croix de Coeur toward La Tzoumaz. It winds through subalpine heath, pines and rhododendrons, crosses the road twice, then finishes with a particularly flowing forest section on soft humus. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-21-debutant-croix-de-coeur-la-tzoumaz-verbier-fr-2794121/">Verbier - Enduro 21</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
