  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Tsopu</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.7 km blue downhill trail. Accessible introduction to downhill riding, with smooth curves across gentle pasture, small jumps and wooden features. Reach the start from Les Ruinettes by following the flat road toward Croix-de-Coeur. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/tsopu-verbier-fr-2794046/">Verbier - Tsopu</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
