  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Bortabitche</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.7 km, +21/-235 m red downhill trail. Sustained red trail from Fontanet beneath La Chaux-Express, alternating technical passages, berms and jumps. Its signature feature is more than 300 m of wooden structures crossing a large rock field before the trail reaches the Ruinettes side of the lift. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/bortabitche-verbier-fr-2794109/">Verbier - Bortabitche</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
