  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Tire's Fire</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.3 km yellow competition downhill trail. Physically and technically demanding competition run from below Les Ruinettes to Medran. Used for Swiss and European cups since 2007, it mixes red- and black-level terrain including steep pitches, rocks, roots, berms and jumps. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/tires-fire-verbier-fr-2794082/">Verbier - Tire's Fire</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
