  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Woooohhh</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.5 km black downhill trail. Short, slow and highly technical black alternative after Wouaiy near Clambin. A dense sequence of jumps and rocky passages leads to the finish at Medran. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/woooohhh-verbier-fr-2794009/">Verbier - Woooohhh</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#line-black</styleUrl>
