  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 23 - Vallon d'Arbi</name>
    <description><![CDATA[11.4 km red enduro route through the Vallon d'Arbi, descending from the high alpine terrain above Lac des Vaux toward La Tzoumaz. It begins with about 250 m of elevation gain on a very steep gravel road. After the climb, the route becomes a technical natural trail through beautiful alpine scenery. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-23-expert-vallon-darbi-verbier-fr-2794083/">Verbier - Enduro 23 Expert Vallon d'Arbi</a>.</i>]]></description>
