  <Placemark>
    <name>La Robella: La Carabosse</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Official 3 km difficult downhill from La Robella to Buttes, with 480 m of descent: approximately 2 km of demanding singletrack and 1 km of asphalt/access track. Expect technical obstacles and large jumps, although the operator says every feature can be bypassed. A sighting lap, full-face helmet and body protection are strongly recommended.<br/><br/>Geometry follows the five MTB downhill sections mapped in OpenStreetMap ways <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/919395620">919395620</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/285345983">285345983</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/285345990">285345990</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/285341626">285341626</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/285240316">285240316</a>, joined along mapped access tracks (ODbL). Indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.<br/><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://www.robella.ch/downhill/">La Robella</a> and <a href="https://schweizmobil.ch/en/mountainbiking-in-switzerland/route-10004">SwitzerlandMobility route 10004</a>.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#line-black</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>6.548824,46.875970,0 6.549403,46.875909,0 6.549361,46.875700,0 6.549570,46.875515,0 6.550509,46.875304,0 6.553015,46.875260,0 6.557724,46.874636,0 6.557483,46.874984,0 6.556984,46.875150,0 6.556988,46.875401,0 6.556069,46.875602,0 6.555947,46.875950,0 6.555607,46.875967,0 6.555853,46.876163,0 6.555015,46.876366,0 6.555542,46.876624,0 6.555502,46.876842,0 6.555927,46.877419,0 6.555714,46.877550,0 6.555960,46.877722,0 6.555780,46.877884,0 6.557647,46.878471,0 6.557144,46.878248,0 6.558807,46.878656,0 6.558865,46.878892,0 6.559065,46.878847,0 6.560085,46.879127,0 6.560836,46.880539,0 6.561685,46.881400,0 6.561989,46.882250,0 6.562241,46.884063,0 6.562082,46.884301,0 6.561391,46.884709,0 6.560725,46.884955,0 6.559926,46.884749,0 6.559730,46.884777,0 6.559654,46.884935,0 6.558662,46.884875,0 6.557486,46.885055,0 6.555920,46.885037,0</coordinates></LineString>
