  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Marbachegg Bike Park [from 38 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Marbachegg 1500 m - top of the gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Home to the Clientis Flowtrail and CKW Jump Trail. The main flow trail drops ~400 meters of elevation over 4.5 km, featuring swooping curves, rollers, table jumps, and wooden step-downs suitable for intermediate and advanced riders. Beautiful setting in the Entlebuch Biosphere.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Gondola access (Sportbahnen Marbachegg). A bike day pass is around 38-42 CHF.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from mid-May; closed from late October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lucerne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.marbachegg.ch/">Marbachegg</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
