  <Placemark>
    <name>Schwarzsee - Riggisalp (Kaiseregg) [from 32 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Riggisalp 1500 m - top of the chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Mix of alpine freeride trails and singletracks leading down from Riggisalp to the lake. The terrain blends fast open alpine pastures, rocky paths, root-filled forest sections, and natural bank turns. Spectacular Fribourg Pre-Alps setting.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>2-seater chairlift (Sesselbahn Riggisalp). Day ticket with unlimited bike transport is approximately 32-38 CHF.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from late May; closed from late October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.schwarzsee.ch/">Schwarzsee</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
