  <Placemark>
    <name>Wiriehorn - Diemtigtal [43 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Wiriehorn - top of the chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The bike park at the head of the Diemtigtal, in a nature park that most people drive straight past. Three downhill runs covering the full range: Alptrail is the gentle learning line, Old T-Bar the intermediate, and Weryhorny the challenging one. Two pumptracks and a kids' park at the bottom make it a good family base, and the valley itself is one of the quietest in the Oberland.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Day pass with trail access 43 CHF adult, 38 CHF youth and seniors; children 6-15 pay their age in francs. Long season - April through mid-November, daily in high summer, with Friday and Saturday evening running until 20:00 in July and August.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 April; closed from 16 November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daytime hours; published Friday and Saturday evening service runs until 20:00 in July and August.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~2h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.wiriehorn.ch/en/summer/bike-park">Wiriehorn</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
