  <Placemark>
    <name>Kandersteg - Sunnbuel [cable car, price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sunnbuel 1936 m - top of the cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A marked freeride route rather than a bike park: the descent from Sunnbuel back down to Kandersteg, with an alternative variant lower down. High, rocky and exposed at the top, then a long technical drop through the gorge. Serious terrain in a serious place - the Gemmi and the Bluemlisalp are right there.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Sunnbuelbahn cable car. Check sunnbuel.ch for bike fare before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.sunnbuel.ch/en/">Sunnbuel cable car</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
