  <Placemark>
    <name>Bellwald (Goms, above Fiesch) [from 40 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Richinen 2000 m - top of the Bellwald gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One of Switzerland's premier bike parks: Forest Bump (flowtrail), Slider Man (jump line), Vast & Furious (high alpine line), and Dirty Cranking (downhill track used for iXS Downhill Cup). Rich variety of drops, gap jumps, technical root lines, and flow turns. South facing, so it dries fast and rides well into October. Bellwald and the wider Aletsch Arena return as a UCI Enduro World Cup venue in 2026 after hosting the 2025 World Championships enduro races.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift access (Sesselbahn Bellwald-Richinen). Bike day pass costs approximately 40-48 CHF.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from late May/early June; closed from late October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~2h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.bellwald.ch/en/bike">Bellwald</a> and <a href="https://www.uci.org/pressrelease/the-uci-and-warner-bros-discovery-unveil-the-calendar-for-the-2026-whoop-uci/6FU08VZbYOFKIftHZjLPO7">2026 UCI calendar</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>8.166794,46.441362,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>bellwald</value></Data>
