  <Placemark>
    <name>Saas-Fee - Kreuzboden/Hohsaas [48 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kreuzboden 2400 m - top of the Saas-Grund gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Kreuzboden-Hohsaas bike area above Saas-Grund is the Saas Valley hub with ~80 km of trails. The Hohsaas Trail starts at 3125 m and drops over 1600 vertical metres past glacial lakes; the Trift Flowtrail runs from Kreuzboden to Saas-Grund. A Bike Skills Park with three short training lines and a conveyor belt sits right at Kreuzboden, and the new Hannig Bike Trail in Saas-Fee adds a separate red/blue loop. The Upper Valais Bike Pass links this spot with Grächen, Belalp, Aletsch Arena and Bellwald on a single ticket.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Biker day ticket 48 CHF (adults without SaastalCard); 15 CHF with SaastalCard (free for hotel guests). Bike transport is free with the Magic Pass. The Upper Valais 3-day Bike Pass is 127 CHF. Check saas-fee.ch before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.saas-fee.ch/en/summer-activities/biking">Saas-Fee</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.964000,46.138300,0</coordinates></Point>
