  <Placemark>
    <name>La Forclaz: Les Rocs Bike Tour</name>
    <description><![CDATA[25 km expert MTB loop with about 1,044 m of climbing. It crosses Les Hauderes and La Forclaz, climbs through the Tsate, Prelet and Cotter alpine pastures, then follows a technical descent towards Villaz and La Sage through high forest, traditional villages and open mountain scenery. This is a demanding pedal-up tour, not a lift-served downhill run. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.evolene-region.ch/fr/bike-tour-sur-les-rocs-fp50706">Evolene Region - Les Rocs Bike Tour</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Evolene Region, simplified to 20 m.</i>]]></description>
