  <Placemark>
    <name>Thyon: Thyon - Veysonnaz via Mayens-de-Sion</name>
    <description><![CDATA[11.5 km, +135/-909 m. A mainly downhill route through the Foret de l'Ours to Mayens-de-Sion. It then climbs gently along the Mayens-de-Salins road before a final, more technical section reaches the Bisse de Vex and returns to Veysonnaz. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.veysonnaz.ch/fr/V2703/itineraire-vtt-thyon-veysonnaz-via-les-mayens-de-sion">Veysonnaz Tourisme - Thyon - Veysonnaz via Mayens-de-Sion</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Veysonnaz Tourisme, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
