  <Placemark>
    <name>Le Chasseron: Chasseron Bike 987</name>
    <description><![CDATA[34 km official, signposted MTB loop from Sainte-Croix via Mont de la Mayaz, the 1607 m Chasseron summit and Les Cluds. It combines 10 km of singletrack with natural-surface and paved linking sections; medium technical difficulty but demanding fitness with about 1200 m of climbing and descent. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.j3l.ch/fr/V2252/a-faire/sport-loisirs/vtt/chasseron-bike">Jura & Trois-Lacs / SwitzerlandMobility</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by the Commune of Bullet, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
