  <Placemark>
    <name>Le Chasseron (Sainte-Croix) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Le Chasseron 1607 m - summit</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Long grassy ridge descents with one of the best panoramas in the Jura - the whole Alpine chain on a clear day. Fast and flowing up high, forest tracks lower down towards Sainte-Croix or Bullet. Pairs well with Le Suchet if you want a big day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Lausanne > Yverdon 25 min > Sainte-Croix 35 min, then about 600 m of climbing from Les Rasses.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 April; closed from 16 November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train</td><td>~1h10</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.yverdonlesbainsregion.ch/en/P38767/le-chasseron">Yverdon region</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.538253,46.851795,0</coordinates></Point>
