  <Placemark>
    <name>Chalet-a-Gobet: Mauvernay 10 km</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Official 10 km family-friendly MTB loop from the Mauvernay sports centre through the Jorat forest, intended as an easy one-hour ride. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.lausanne.ch/vie-pratique/sport-pour-tous/installations-sportives/liste-installations-sportives/parcours-vtt-mauvernay.html">City of Lausanne</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
