  <Placemark>
    <name>Chalet-a-Gobet: Mauvernay 20 km</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Official 20 km MTB loop from the Mauvernay sports centre, extending the shorter course deeper into the Jorat forest for an easy ride of about two hours. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.lausanne.ch/vie-pratique/sport-pour-tous/installations-sportives/liste-installations-sportives/parcours-vtt-mauvernay.html">City of Lausanne</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
