  <Placemark>
    <name>Les Arcs Bike Park (Bourg-Saint-Maurice) [30 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Arc 1600, 1620 m - funicular arrival and Cachette lift hub</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>More than 150 km of marked riding across Les Arcs and Peisey-Vallandry: seven dedicated downhill trails, eight enduro routes and six e-MTB, cross-country and gravel routes. There is a green learning area and easy lines, while Cachette, La 8 and Dre dans l'Pentu provide long, technical black descents.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The peak-season 2026 adult bike-park day pass is 30 EUR and covers twelve lifts. The mountain area runs from 13 June to 13 September 2026, with the full network operating from 4 July to 29 August; preview and late-season lift coverage is reduced.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 13 June; closed from 14 September (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:30<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h00</td></tr><tr><td>Bourg-Saint-Maurice</td><td>Funicular</td><td>~7 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://en.lesarcs.com/bike-park">Les Arcs</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
