  <Placemark>
    <name>Valberg (Alpes-Maritimes) [16 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Eguilles 1875 m - top of the Eguilles chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Seven downhill runs in the Garibeuil sector, all fed by one chairlift and all finishing back at the bottom station, so laps are quick. About 400 m of descent each. The black line traced by world champion Loic Bruni holds the technical sections; the rest is flowing and well within reach of an intermediate.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Eguilles chairlift takes riders and bikes up in about 8 minutes. Bike day pass 16 EUR for adults, 14 EUR under 16. Pre-opening weekends from 13 June, then daily 27 June to 30 August 2026.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 27 June; closed from 31 August (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Nice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.valberg.com/les-activites/velo-vtt/bike-park/">Valberg</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
