  <Placemark>
    <name>Mont Gros: summit to Roquebrune via Col de la Coupiere</name>
    <description><![CDATA[4.4 km natural descent from Mont Gros to the road above Roquebrune-Cap-Martin. Before the Col de la Coupiere it follows the singletrack past the small pond and picnic table. From the col it takes the right-hand trail through La Coupiere and the unnamed 452 m summit. The lower section is T4 / E2 with numerous obstacles and is normally ridden downhill only. <i>Sources: <a href="https://vttour.fr/sentiers/223">VTTour sentier 223</a>; summit-to-col geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap ways <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/93220573">93220573</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/93220584">93220584</a> (ODbL).</i>]]></description>
