  <Placemark>
    <name>Ravin du Rank: Col de la Madone > Gorbio</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.743 km descent from the Col de la Madone toward Gorbio, dropping 554 m: hyper-rough, narrow and ridden downhill only. <i>Source: <a href="https://vttour.fr/sentiers/83">VTTour sentier 83</a> (T5/E2).</i>]]></description>
