  <Placemark>
    <name>Bjelasnica Bike Park (Bosnia and Herzegovina) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>K1 ski lift - lift-assisted gravity above Babin Do</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Bosnia's clearest operating bike park uses purpose-built downhill and enduro terrain on the Olympic mountain. Expect open ski-slope sections, rocky technical ground and wooded lower trails rather than a large network of machine-built flow.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The K1 surface lift uses a special bicycle hook to tow riders and bikes uphill. Check the Olympic Centre for the current bike ticket and operating days.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 June; closed from 01 October (typical summer operating window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:00<br/><small>Season and hours are estimates; confirm the K1 bike-lift schedule before travel.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sarajevo</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://ocbjelasnica.com/bike-park/">OC Bjelasnica Bike Park</a>. Prices, lift operation and trail status can change.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>18.282900,43.714791,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app"><Data name="spot"><value>bjelasnica</value></Data><Data name="tags"><value>expert bike-park dh enduro</value></Data><Data name="open_from"><value>06-01</value></Data><Data name="closed_from"><value>10-01</value></Data><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Jahorina Bike Park (Bosnia and Herzegovina) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Olympic Centre gravity trail above Poljice</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A resort-operated bike trail on the 1984 Olympic mountain, combining open alpine riding with forest and shaped gravity sections. The developing park is suitable for confident riders but has less documented progression terrain than the large Alpine resorts.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer resort uplift serves the bike trail when scheduled. Check Jahorina for the current lift, bike transport and ticket details.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 15 September (typical summer window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; verify that bike uplift is operating on the selected date.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sarajevo</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.oc-jahorina.com/en/bike-staza/">Olympic Centre Jahorina</a>. Verify current summer operations.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>18.566872,43.736783,0</coordinates></Point>
