  <Placemark>
    <name>Fassa Bike Park (Canazei, Dolomites) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Canazei-Pecol lifts in the Val di Fassa Dolomites</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A major Dolomites gravity hub with shaped downhill and flow around Canazei, natural enduro, steep roots and rock, and lift-linked access toward the Sellaronda MTB Tour. Trails range from approachable blues to technical World Series-grade terrain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Canazei-Pecol gondola and Val di Fassa lifts carry bikes; check Fassa Bike for current pass prices.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 13 June; closed from 28 September (published 2026 Canazei-Pecol dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:30-17:00<br/><small>Typical lift hours; individual sectors have different calendars.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bolzano</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr><tr><td>Canazei</td><td>Bike</td><td>~5 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.fassabike.com/bike-park/aperture-e-costi/">Fassa Bike</a>. Verify sector and lift status.</i>]]></description>
