  <Placemark>
    <name>Bormio Bike Park (Valtellina) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bormio 2000 lift sector above the Stelvio valley</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A revived high-vertical park with downhill race terrain, fast alpine pistes, shaped flow and technical forest sections. The 2026 reopening also hosts a round of the Internazionali d'Italia Downhill.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Bormio lifts carry bikes to the park; check the operator for current tickets and open sectors.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 18 July; closed from 13 September (2026 opening date and estimated closing window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Closing date and hours are estimates; verify the 2026 calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Tirano</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bormio</td><td>Bike / lift</td><td>~10 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bormioski.eu/en/blog/events/bormio-bike-park-reopens-kick-off-the-downhill-season-with-a-special-2-for-1-offer/">Bormio Ski 2026 announcement</a>. Verify current operations.</i>]]></description>
