  <Placemark>
    <name>Madebike Park Madesimo (Valchiavenna) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Larici gondola to Alpe Groppera</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A compact Lombardy park specializing in downhill and freeride, with beginner flow, technical wooded gravity tracks, rocks and race lines. The gondola gives fast repeated laps from the pedestrian centre.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Larici gondola carries bikes in under five minutes. Check Skiarea Valchiavenna for the current bike pass.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 20 June; closed from 13 September (2026 opening date and typical closing window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical hours; consult the 2026 lift calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Chiavenna</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Milan</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.madesimo.eu/it/esperienze/madebike-park/">Madesimo Tourism</a>. Verify lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>9.358414,46.436298,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app"><Data name="spot"><value>madebike-madesimo</value></Data><Data name="tags"><value>beginner expert bike-park dh freeride</value></Data><Data name="open_from"><value>06-20</value></Data><Data name="closed_from"><value>09-13</value></Data><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
