  <Placemark>
    <name>Bardonecchia Bike Park (Piedmont) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served gravity across the Bardonecchia ski sectors</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A large western-Alps park with downhill, freeride, cross-country and enduro across open alpine slopes and larch woods. The network offers family progression as well as long technical descents and race-style lines.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer resort lifts carry bikes; check Bardonecchia for the current pass and operating sectors.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 27 June; closed from 06 September (typical main season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated standard hours; verify the lift calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Turin</td><td>Train</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Bardonecchia station</td><td>Bike</td><td>~10 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://bardonecchia.it/strutture/bardonecchia-bike-park/">Bardonecchia Tourism</a>. Verify current operations.</i>]]></description>
