    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served Maritime Alps bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A major northwest Italian park with downhill, freeride and flow lines over open ski terrain and lower woods. Progression trails sit beside technical race tracks, jumps and fast machine-shaped berms.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer chairlifts carry bikes; check Prato Nevoso for current pricing.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 13 June; closed from 27 September (typical summer and weekend window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; confirm open days and lift status.</small><br/><br/>
