    <name>Cimone Bike Park (Sestola, Emilia-Romagna) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Monte Cimone lift network above Sestola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A broad Apennine destination mixing lift-served downhill, freeride, enduro and trail riding. Volcanic-looking rock, roots and long forest lines range from smooth flow to technical black descents.<br/><br/>
