  <Placemark>
    <name>Les Orres Bike Park (Hautes-Alpes) [28 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Three chairlifts above Les Orres 1650 and 1800</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One of France's original purpose-built bike parks, with a broad progression from family flow to World Cup-level downhill, rough roots, steep natural lines and major freeride features. The long vertical and famously shaped tracks make it a national gravity destination.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Prelongis, Pic Vert and Pousterle chairlifts serve the park. Adult day pass 28 EUR at the published 2026 opening tariff.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 13 June; closed from 14 September (published 2026 main season plus September weekends).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Published standard hours; lift availability varies by period and weather.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Gap</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Embrun</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.lesorres.com/espace-presse/saison-d-ete-2026-c-est-parti">Les Orres 2026 season</a> and <a href="https://www.lesorres.com/activites-et-animations/programme-des-animations/opening-les-orres-bike-park">opening information</a>. Verify live lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
