  <Placemark>
    <name>Les Saisies Bike Park (Beaufortain) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served Beaufortain park facing Mont Blanc</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A complete all-level destination with downhill tracks, enduro routes, FFC cross-country loops, play zones and pump track. The terrain mixes approachable flow with roots, steeper forest and technical expert lines.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer lifts carry bikes; check the resort for current passes.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 15 September (typical published summer window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Estimated standard hours; verify the daily lift schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Albertville</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Annecy</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://en.lessaisies.com/accessible-mountains-in-summer/mountain-biking-for-all/bike-park-2/">Les Saisies official tourism</a>. Verify current operations.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.539448,45.757330,0</coordinates></Point>
