  <Placemark>
    <name>Super-Besse Bike Park (Massif du Sancy) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served volcanic park below Puy de Sancy</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A compact all-level park with shaped flow, downhill and enduro on open volcanic slopes and lower forest. Weather changes quickly and the harder lines become slick and exposed in rain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer lifts carry bikes; check the Sancy operator for current pricing.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 04 July; closed from 30 August (typical main season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated standard hours; verify weather and lift status.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Clermont-Ferrand</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.sancy.com/">Massif du Sancy Tourism</a>. Verify current bike-park operations.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>2.856158,45.511458,0</coordinates></Point>
