  <Placemark>
    <name>Ax 3 Domaines Bike Park (Ariege Pyrenees) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served Pyrenean park above Ax-les-Thermes</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Long mountain descents combine bike-park shaping with natural Pyrenean roots, rock and forest. Green and blue routes support progression while the hard DH and enduro lines use the resort's substantial vertical.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer lifts carry bikes from the Bonascre plateau; check Ax for current tariffs.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 04 July; closed from 30 August (typical main season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated standard hours; verify the published operating calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Toulouse</td><td>Train + gondola / car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr><tr><td>Ax-les-Thermes</td><td>Gondola</td><td>~10 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.ax.ski/">Ax 3 Domaines</a>. Verify summer bike access and lift status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>1.815209,42.700577,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app"><Data name="spot"><value>ax-3-domaines</value></Data><Data name="tags"><value>beginner expert bike-park dh enduro</value></Data><Data name="open_from"><value>07-04</value></Data><Data name="closed_from"><value>08-30</value></Data><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>EVO Bike Park (Digne-les-Bains) [shuttle park]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Purpose-built gravity park in the Alpes-de-Haute-Provence</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Eleven park pistes: 2 blue, 4 red and 4 black, plus one additional line listed by the park. Named lines include Savage Train, Dirty Wave, Slate Line, Jungle Trail, Whip It, North Shore, Chainsaw, Original Gangsta, Double Black Mamba, Griffus Line and Stratos Line. The terrain combines shaped flow, jumps, technical rock, steep race sections and freeride features.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The park operates its own truck-and-trailer shuttle system. The day ticket is 35 EUR. Booking is required; check EVO for current sessions and pricing.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round, subject to booking, weather and maintenance. Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:30; winter uplift typically ends at 17:00.<br/><small>Check the operator calendar before travelling.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Digne-les-Bains</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Marseille</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://evobikepark.com/bike-park/">EVO Bike Park trail list</a> and <a href="https://evobikepark.com/">EVO Bike Park practical information</a>. Book and verify current trail status before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.266533,44.110976,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app"><Data name="spot"><value>evo-bike-park</value></Data><Data name="tags"><value>beginner expert bike-park dh enduro freeride</value></Data><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Orcieres Bike Park (Champsaur) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>High-alpine park above Orcieres Merlette 1850</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A sunny Southern Alps network with long downhill and enduro routes, open alpine flow, larch forest, technical rock and large vertical toward the Champsaur valley. It caters to beginners but has serious red and black terrain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer gondolas and chairlifts carry bikes; check the resort for the current pass.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 27 June; closed from 30 August (typical main season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated standard hours; verify the lift calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Gap</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.orcieres.com/">Orcieres Tourism</a>. Verify current bike-park operations.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.322065,44.696511,0</coordinates></Point>
