  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Ferme Libert (Malmedy, Belgium) [10 EUR / 10 lifts]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ferme Libert ski tow - gravity riding above Malmedy</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One of the Benelux's most established gravity parks, with several downhill and freeride lines dropping about 110 m over runs 600-900 m long. Expect roots, steep forest sections, jumps and large freeride features; the hill has hosted Belgian downhill races and Fest Series sessions.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The ski tow carries riders and bikes. Ten uplifts cost 10 EUR; downhill-bike and protection rental is available.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 April; closed from 1 December (typical riding window).<br/>Daily opening hours: schedule varies weekly<br/><small>The operator publishes changing opening days and hours; check before travelling.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Liege</td><td>Car</td><td>~55 min</td></tr><tr><td>Malmedy</td><td>Bike / car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bike-park-fermelibert.com/fr/accueil.htm">Bike Park Ferme Libert</a>. Opening, uplift and trail conditions can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
