  <Placemark>
    <name>Boy Konen Bike Park (Luxembourg City) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Municipal MTB and BMX skills park in Cessange</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Luxembourg's most complete compact skills park combines enduro, North Shore, pump, BMX and progressive jump lines. Colour-coded tracks range from easy practice terrain to hard lines with rocks, logs, tight turns and larger tables.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Free and pedal-accessed; there is no lift. The City may close the park for bad weather, maintenance, club sessions or events.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 January; closed from 01 January (normally year-round, excluding weather and maintenance closures).<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-21:00<br/><small>Published municipal hours.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Luxembourg station</td><td>Bike</td><td>~20 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.vdl.lu/en/visiting/sport-and-leisure/sporting-facilities/boy-konen-bike-park">City of Luxembourg</a>. Check current closures before riding.</i>]]></description>
