  <Placemark>
    <name>MTB Zone Bikepark Willingen (Germany) [46 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ettelsberg gondola and K1 chairlift - two-sided gravity hill</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Ten maintained trails total about 15 km, with easier flow and progression lines on one side of the Ettelsberg and harder downhill, enduro and freeride terrain on the other. Bike schools, rentals and the adjoining Green Trails make it unusually beginner-friendly for a serious park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Ettelsberg gondola and K1 eight-seat chairlift carry bikes. Adult day pass 46 EUR; season pass 445 EUR. Some multi-day tickets also cover Winterberg.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 28 March; closed from 09 November (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00; Fridays to 19:00 through August<br/><small>Published 2026 hours; check the operating calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Dortmund</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr><tr><td>Willingen station</td><td>Bike</td><td>~10 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.mtbzone-bike-park.com/en/willingen">MTB Zone Willingen</a> and its <a href="https://mtbzone-bike-park.com/en/willingen/tickets">2026 ticket page</a>. Check live trail and lift status.</i>]]></description>
