  <Placemark>
    <name>Green Hill Bikepark (Schmallenberg, Germany) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Dedicated uplift park in the Sauerland</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A modern purpose-built park known for sculpted jump lines, fast flow, technical downhill and freeride features. The progressive layout gives competent beginners options while the larger gaps, drops and steep lines target experienced riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The park's surface lift provides repeated uplifts. Current ticket prices and operating days are published by the operator and vary through the season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 April; closed from 09 November (typical season; check the calendar).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated standard hours; confirm the day's uplift schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Dortmund</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h40</td></tr><tr><td>Winterberg</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://greenhill-bike-park.de/">Green Hill Bikepark</a>. Prices, opening and trail status can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
