  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Thy MTB Park (Denmark) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Purpose-built trail centre in the Thy forest landscape</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three marked MTB routes form a compact destination for half- or full-day riding in the sandy, wooded terrain of northwest Jutland. The emphasis is flowing natural singletrack and trail-centre riding rather than large elevation, with options for mixed abilities.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Free and pedal-accessed; no lift.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 January; closed from 01 January (normally year-round).<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/><small>Check forestry notices and trail conditions, especially after severe weather.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Thisted</td><td>Car / bike</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Aalborg</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.visitdenmark.com/denmark/plan-your-trip/thy-mtb-park-gdk1153522">VisitDenmark</a>. Follow local trail signs and closures.</i>]]></description>
