  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Niseko Hanazono Mountain Bike Park (Hokkaido) [3800 JPY]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hanazono gondola - lift-accessed Niseko flow trails</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A new purpose-built gravity park opened in July 2026, designed by Allegra with local supervision from NAMBA. Hanazono Skyline is a 4.2 km blue flow descent with about 347 m of vertical; the free 1.36 km Mori Loop gives beginners a gentler introduction near the base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Hanazono gondola carries bikes. Adult day pass 3800 JPY, child 2500 JPY; adult season pass 28000 JPY. Rentals and protective equipment are available.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 July; closed from 12 October (2026 opening date and estimated autumn closing window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:00<br/><small>Closing date and daily hours are estimates; check the operator schedule and trail status.</small><br/><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://hanazononiseko.com/en/newsrelease/mtb-trails-2026-6-30">Niseko Hanazono</a> and <a href="https://namba.ngo/">NAMBA</a>.
    Prices, schedules and conditions can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>140.699722,42.893056,0</coordinates></Point>
