  <Placemark>
    <name>Hakuba 47 Mountain Bike Park (Nagano) [1200 JPY, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Beginner-focused trail and skills park at the Hakuba 47 base</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three main trails and an absolute-beginner practice area focus on accessible progression: gentle singletrack, rollers, berm-like turns, rocks, narrow-path practice and a children's course. Bikes and protection can be rented at the resort.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Current park trails are in the base area and are ridden under pedal power. Entry with your own bike is 1200 JPY for a day or 600 JPY for two hours; rental packages include park entry.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 17 July; closed from 24 September (2026 opening date and estimated late-September closing window; closed 24-26 July for a private event).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:00<br/><small>Closing date and daily hours are estimates; check the resort before travel.</small><br/><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.hakuba47.co.jp/summer/en/mtb/">Hakuba 47 MTB</a> and the <a href="https://www.hakuba47.co.jp/summer/en/">2026 summer page</a>.
    Prices, schedules and conditions can change.</i>]]></description>
