  <Placemark>
    <name>Downhill MTB Kitulgala (Sri Lanka) [truck shuttle]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Purpose-built tropical gravity trail at Kitulgala</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Sri Lanka's dedicated downhill MTB operation combines purpose-built and natural trail through lush forest and villages. The guided three-hour experience starts with induction and practice, then follows a gravity descent suitable for beginners through experienced riders, ending with a river swim.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A truck shuttles riders to the top, so there is no uphill pedalling. Bikes, helmet, safety equipment and assistance are included in the booked experience. Pricing varies by booking date and group; reserve with the operator.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January; closed from 1 January (operates by reservation year-round, subject to rain and trail conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical booking window; confirm the meeting time and conditions directly.</small><br/><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://mountainbike-parksrilanka.com/">Downhill MTB Sri Lanka</a> and its linked booking information. Availability and prices can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
