  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Schladming - Planai (Styria) [58.50 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Planai 1820 m - top of the Planaibahn</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>42 km of trail down a single big face, and the one Austrian park with real World Cup history under it. The 2.5 km World Cup downhill runs from the mid-station to the valley and links out of the 2.6 km Downhill Pro above it, which is as serious as Austrian racing gets. Everything else is built for airtime or for learning: the Flowline, the 99 Jumpline, the Monster Jumpline, and a Rookie Trail that actually works as a first descent.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Planaibahn gondola runs in two sections from Schladming at 740 m. Day pass 58.50 EUR adult, 44.50 EUR youth. Open daily 29 May to 21 September 2026, then Thursday to Sunday until 5 October. The Gravity Card is accepted.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 29 May; closed from 6 October (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:30-16:30<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Salzburg</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr><tr><td>Vienna</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.schladming-dachstein.at/en/summer/biking/bike-park-schladming">Schladming-Dachstein</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
