  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Serfaus-Fiss-Ladis (Tirol) [38.50 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Moeseralm 1820 m - top of the Moeseralmbahn, Fiss</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Nine park trails from green to black, and the reason to come: two of the longest singletracks in the Alps drop off the ridge above. The Frommestrail runs 9.8 km for 900 m of descent, and the Zirbentrail 9.1 km through stone pine forest, both starting from the Schoenjoch at 2420 m. Down at the valley station there is a kids park, a pumptrack and a slopestyle zone, which makes this the best of the Austrian parks to bring a family to.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Moeseralmbahn gondola from Fiss serves the park trails; the Schoenjochbahn continues to 2420 m for the long singletracks. Day pass 38.50 EUR adult, 33 EUR from midday. Lifts 8:30 to 17:00, season 13 June to 11 October 2026.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 13 June; closed from 12 October (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:30-17:00<br/><small>Published operating hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Innsbruck</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bike-sfl.at/en">Bikepark Serfaus-Fiss-Ladis</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
