  <Placemark>
    <name>Pizol (Bad Ragaz / Wangs, St. Gallen) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pizolhütte 2220 m - top of the Gaffia-Pizolhütte chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Seven official MTB tours totalling 5.6 to 35.4 km descend from the Pizol massif on natural alpine tracks and forest roads back to Wangs and Bad Ragaz. The riding is scenic and intermediate, with the 5-Seen-Wanderung panorama as the backdrop. This is trail riding with a view, not a built bike park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Two gondola accesses: Wangs to Furt (Pizolbahnen) or Bad Ragaz to Pardiel, then chairlifts to the high terrain. Bike surcharge: 5 CHF single, 15 CHF / 3 rides, 65 CHF season pass, on top of the passenger ticket.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (estimated summer lift window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:30-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check Pizolbahnen summer timetable.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h10</td></tr><tr><td>Sargans</td><td>Bus</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.pizol.com/sommer/mountainbiken">Pizolbahnen</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
