  <Placemark>
    <name>Pilatus / Fräkmüntegg (Luzern) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Fräkmüntegg 1410 m - top of the Kriens gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Technical natural singletrack descends from Fräkmüntegg and Pilatus Kulm (2014 m, reached by a second cable car) toward Kriens and Alpnach. This is raw Prealp riding, not a shaped bike park: steep forest trails, roots and switchbacks from the Krienseregg mid-station down to the Luzern suburbs. The upper Pilatus Kulm sector is high-alpine and exposed.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The gondola from Kriens (Luzern) carries bikes to Fräkmüntegg; the Pilatus Kulm cable car above it may not accept bicycles. Day return from Kriens is about 72 CHF; confirm the current bike surcharge before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from November (estimated summer gondola window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:30-17:30<br/><small>Estimated hours; verify Pilatus Bahnen summer schedule and bike carriage policy.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lucerne</td><td>Bus + gondola</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Train + bus + gondola</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.pilatus.ch/en/">Pilatus Bahnen</a>. Confirm bike carriage, trail conditions and lift prices before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>8.25137,46.99082,0</coordinates></Point>
