  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Rabac (HR) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Rabac, Istria - purpose-built coastal trail centre</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A compact purpose-built network above the Adriatic, part of the wider Maslinica trail system. It mixes easier flow and family trails with rocky technical descents, switchbacks, pump-track features and harder downhill-style lines on dry limestone terrain. The sea views and mild coast climate make it a particularly useful shoulder-season destination, with Bike Center Rabac providing rental, repairs, washing, storage and guided rides.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift: pedal the climbing roads and connectors or arrange transport through a local operator. Trail access is generally free; rentals and guided services are separate. Rock is sharp and polished in places, so sturdy tyres and protection are sensible.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January with no seasonal closure in a typical year. The destination markets year-round cycling; avoid the hottest summer afternoons and check trail conditions after storms.<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-18:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Pula</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Rijeka</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.valamar.com/en/croatia/rabac/biking">Rabac cycling and Bike Center services</a> and <a href="https://bike4you.hr/bike-park-rabac/">Bike Park Rabac overview</a>.</i>]]></description>
