  <Placemark>
    <name>Enduro Trails Srebrna Gora (PL) [shuttle price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Srebrna Gora - shuttle-assisted Lower Silesian enduro</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Long purpose-built and natural descents use roughly 330 m of vertical around the historic fortress. Lines range from flowing intermediate riding to steep technical enduro with rock, roots and tight forest sections; SGR Line is the signature expert descent.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Commercial vans and trailers provide booked uplift, with pedalling also possible. Current shuttle prices vary by package and were not reliably published in the sources checked.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 April; closed from 1 December (typical riding and shuttle window; check booking availability).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Wroclaw</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Prague</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.srebrna.com/rowery/">Srebrna Gora trail information</a> and NS Bikeparks; reserve uplift in advance.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
