  <Placemark>
    <name>Valgehobusemae Bike Trail (Estonia) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Valgehobusemae Recreation Centre - long forest and bog-country MTB loop</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A signed cross-country route of up to 50 km circles Valgehobusemae and Kakerdaja bog. Expect forest tracks, rolling singletrack and remote sections rather than gravity-park features; shorter options suit less experienced riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift: the network is ridden as pedal-powered loops. Access information and bike rental are available from the recreation centre.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 2 October (published cycling season).<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Tallinn</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Tartu</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://visitestonia.com/en/valgehobusemae-bike-trail">Visit Estonia trail listing</a>; carry food, water and navigation.</i>]]></description>
