    <name>Riekstukalns DH Trails (Latvia) [no public uplift verified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Riekstukalns near Baldone - Latvia's most established downhill training hill</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Short, steep community-maintained downhill lines use the ski hill's compact vertical, with roots, jumps and race-oriented features. This is a local training venue rather than a full-service destination park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No dependable public bike uplift was verified: expect push-up or pedal access unless an event announces otherwise. Confirm access with the local downhill community.<br/><br/>
