    <name>Sigulda DH Trails (Latvia) [no public uplift verified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Gauja valley slopes at Sigulda - Latvian downhill and enduro terrain</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Short, steep natural descents around the deeply cut Gauja valley support local downhill training and racing. Expect roots, loam and compact technical runs rather than a signed commercial bike-park network.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No dependable public bike uplift was verified. Use pedal or push-up access and confirm the current legal training location with local riders before setting out.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (typical regional riding window). Weather, events and protected-area rules may restrict individual trails.<br/><br/>
