  <Placemark>
    <name>Molyne Bike Park (Vilnius, LT) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Plytines forest in Vilnius - small community skills and trail park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A compact community-built area with an easy family trail and a jump line. The vertical is modest, but it is Lithuania's clearest purpose-built MTB progression spot and can be linked with longer forest riding around Antakalnis.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift: pedal or push back to the starts. No mandatory access price was verified; respect community maintenance and any posted forest rules.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 April; closed from 1 December (typical riding window). Avoid wet or freeze-thaw conditions that damage the small trail network.<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-18:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Vilnius centre</td><td>Bike / car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.molyne.lt/">Molyne community site</a> and current trail reports; verify local status.</i>]]></description>
