  <Placemark>
    <name>Le Grand-Bornand: Enduro du Grand-Bo</name>
    <description><![CDATA[10.4 km. A long marked route from the Rosay sector combining several technical natural descents with pedalling links into the village. <i>Source and geometry: <a href="https://www.legrandbornand.com/quoi-faire/enduro-du-grand-bo-itineraire-vtt-enduro-n6-le-grand-bornand-fr-5595653/">official trail page</a>.</i>]]></description>
