  <Placemark>
    <name>Pomeranos DH Trails (Pomerode, BR) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pomerode hills - Santa Catarina downhill race terrain</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Steep subtropical forest descents used by the established Pomeranos downhill scene, with roots, red dirt, chutes and race-built technical sections. This is not confirmed as a continuously operated commercial park, so expect local trails rather than a staffed facility.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No public lift or standard shuttle was verified. Pedal or arrange access with local riders, and confirm landowner permission before riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round when dry; avoid the clay trails after heavy rain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Blumenau</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.scciclismo.com.br/">Santa Catarina Cycling Federation</a>, which lists Pomeranos downhill events in Pomerode. Confirm current local access.</i>]]></description>
