  <Placemark>
    <name>Chestnut Nature Park MTB Trails (Singapore) [no lift, free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Chestnut Nature Park - purpose-built urban singletrack</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Singapore's largest nature park separates designated MTB and hiking routes, with rolling singletrack, berms, rock features and mixed-difficulty loops in an 81 ha forest setting. Ride only the marked MTB trails.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Free pedal access; no lift. Protect the trail surface by staying away in heavy rain and obey NParks closures.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round. <br/>Daily opening hours: 07:00-19:00<br/><small>Published NParks opening hours; temporary weather closures may apply.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Central Singapore</td><td>Metro/bus + bike</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.nparks.gov.sg/visit/parks/park-detail/chestnut-nature-park">Singapore NParks</a>.</i>]]></description>
