  <Placemark>
    <name>Ketam Mountain Bike Park (Pulau Ubin, SG) [no lift, free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ketam Quarry, Pulau Ubin - international-standard XC park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Ten kilometres of purpose-built tracks around a former quarry, graded from blue square through black and double black. Expect narrow low-grip trail, long stepped climbs, drops, sharp corners and steep technical obstacles rather than uplifted downhill.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Free pedal access; no lift. Reach Pulau Ubin by bumboat from Changi Point, then ride from the village. Boat space and bicycle charges vary.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round in daylight, subject to ferry service, rain and NParks closures. <br/>Daily opening hours: 07:00-19:00<br/><small>Daylight estimate; ferry service and NParks closures control practical access.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Central Singapore</td><td>Bus/taxi + bumboat + bike</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://pulau-ubin.nparks.gov.sg/activities/cycling/">Singapore NParks Pulau Ubin cycling guide</a>.</i>]]></description>
