  <Placemark>
    <name>Mount Tochal / Tehran Foothills (IR) [gondola bike access unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Tochal above Tehran - huge vertical and technical foothill paths</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Alborz rises directly from the city to almost 4,000 m. Rough natural paths around Darakeh and the mid-mountain stations offer rocky, exposed descending, but they are shared hiking terrain rather than sanctioned bike-park runs.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Tochal Telecabin reaches high stations, but current bicycle carriage could not be confirmed. Ask the operator before relying on it; road shuttle and pedalling are safer planning assumptions.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Lower foothills are broadly year-round; high routes are normally June-October. <br/>Daily opening hours: 07:30-15:00<br/><small>Typical gondola estimate; confirm current operation and bicycle acceptance.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Central Tehran</td><td>Car / taxi</td><td>~35 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: Tochal Complex gondola infrastructure; confirm bicycle rules and stay off pedestrian-only paths.</i><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.tochal.org/en/">Tochal</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
