  <Placemark>
    <name>Thaiwoo Bike Park (Chongli, CN) [gondola price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Thaiwoo Ski Town - China's flagship lift-served bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Purpose-built summer MTB terrain with gondola-served flow, jumps, pump-track facilities and technical downhill on the Olympic-region mountains. The operator actively lists mountain biking among its summer sports.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer gondola uplift is offered, but a current public bike-pass price was not reliably available in English. Confirm ticketing and trail status directly.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (typical Chongli bike season). <br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical summer estimate; check the official daily schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Beijing</td><td>Fast train + taxi</td><td>~2h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.thaiwoo.com/summer">official Thaiwoo summer activities</a>.</i>]]></description>
