  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Yetopia MTB Park (Yilan, TW) [shuttle, NT$300]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Taiwan's only purpose-built mountain bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three downhill/enduro trails descend from the ridge above Toucheng: Wild Boar (0.8 km, 226 m drop, easy flow), Muntjac (1.1 km, 202 m drop, medium, rocky/rooty) and Timber Trail (0.8 km, 100 m drop, hard, drops and off-camber). A 20 km XC loop (1,000 m ascent) and a pump track round out the park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No mechanical lift. Shuttle van uplift: NT$500 half-day, NT$800 full-day (unlimited laps). Trail pass: NT$300/day. Full-suspension rental: NT$1,500/day. Summer season pass NT$1,500 (Jul-Nov). Guided sessions available.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; avoid typhoon months (late July to mid September).<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Taipei</td><td>Train + transfer</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Yilan / Jiaoxi</td><td>Car / taxi</td><td>~30 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://yetopia.tw">official Yetopia</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
