  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Domaine de Deva MTB (Bourail, NC) [no lift, free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>New Caledonia's major coastal trail park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>An extensive marked network crosses dry forest, ridges and lagoon-facing terrain, with green family riding through technical red routes. Individual circuits include the 12.4 km Blue Riviere de Deva loop. Trails are unsupervised.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Free pedal access; no lift. Start from the Domaine de Deva reception and choose a signed loop appropriate to conditions.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round, but wildfire danger, storms or maintenance can close the domain. <br/>Daily opening hours: 06:30-19:00<br/><small>Published domain hours; fire-risk and weather closures apply.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Noumea</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h</td></tr><tr><td>Bourail</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.newcaledonia.travel/offers/mountain-bike-trail-n-9-blue-riviere-de-deva-bourail-en-3913712/">New Caledonia Tourism</a>. Check the domain's fire-risk status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
