  <Placemark>
    <name>Christchurch Adventure Park (NZ) [chairlift, NZD 95/day]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Year-round chairlift gravity park in Christchurch's Port Hills</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Machine- and hand-built downhill trails cover beginner flow, intermediate progression, large jump tracks and technical expert terrain. The chairlift provides repeated gravity laps, with rental bikes, protection, lessons and patrol available.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The 1.8 km chairlift carries bikes. Adult day pass: NZD 95; single uplift: NZD 30. Riders under 10 ride free with required supervision. Prices checked July 2026.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round on published operating days. Winter 2026: closed Monday-Tuesday; Wednesday-Friday 11:00-17:00 and weekends/holidays 10:00-17:00, with some Wednesday night rides. <br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical operating hours; winter weekdays may start at 11:00, Monday-Tuesday closures and night-ride extensions apply.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Central Christchurch</td><td>Car / bike</td><td>~20 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://christchurchadventurepark.com/experiences/mountain-biking-christchurch">official MTB pricing</a> and <a href="https://christchurchadventurepark.com/park-status">live park status</a>.</i>]]></description>
