  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>North Basse-Terre MTB (Sainte-Rose, GP) [guided, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Guided tropical trail riding between coast and rainforest</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Local routes around Sainte-Rose combine sugar-cane tracks, mangrove edges, riverbeds, tropical forest and steeper natural singletrack. The best connections are deliberately not published on standard maps, making this a guided riding zone rather than a signed trail centre.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. VELOC offers mountain-bike rental, delivery and local route advice or accompaniment from Sainte-Rose. Confirm the selected route, difficulty and price directly.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Guiding and rental are listed year-round in 2026; December-May usually offers drier riding. Routes can close after storms, flooding or forestry damage.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Pointe-a-Pitre</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Deshaies</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.lesilesdeguadeloupe.com/commerce-service/veloc-location-de-vtt/">Guadeloupe Islands tourism listing</a> and <a href="https://www.veloc.org/">VELOC</a>.</i>]]></description>
