  <Placemark>
    <name>Postavaru Bike Park (Poiana Brasov, RO) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Brasov's lift-served Carpathian gravity network</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Long natural descents from Postavaru combine roots, loam, rocks and purpose-built bike-park sections, with lines for intermediate through expert riders. Conditions change quickly after rain and trail works.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Poiana Brasov gondola access is used for bike uplift when summer operations permit. Confirm bike carriage, current trails and pass price before departure.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Typically late May-October, subject to maintenance and weather. 2026 trail preparation was underway in May. <br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical summer estimate; verify gondola bike carriage and live trail status.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Brasov</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Current 2026 riding is documented by local Brasov reporting; verify status with Poiana Brasov.</i><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.poianabrasov.com/en/">Poiana Brasov</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
