  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bukovel Bike Park (Ukraine) [chairlift, UAH 800/day]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ukraine's principal lift-served downhill park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One blue, two red and one black downhill trail use jumps, narrow bridges and natural forest obstacles. Lift 2 carries bicycles.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>2026 advertised adult price: UAH 800/day, UAH 550 half-day or UAH 350 single ride.<br/><br/><p class="warn">&#9888;&#65039; Ukraine remains at war. Missile and drone attacks can occur in western regions; multiple governments advise against non-essential or all travel. Do not treat resort operation as evidence that travel is safe.</p>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer operation is advertised, but dates and security conditions can change without notice. <br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-18:00<br/><small>Published hours; security, curfew, weather and lift closures can override them.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ivano-Frankivsk</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~2h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://bukovel.com/en/summer/velopark">official Bukovel Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/ukraine">current Ukraine travel advice</a>.</i>]]></description>
