  <Placemark>
    <name>Flying Monkey</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Mapped 2.3 km central descent of the BLM's 2.53-mile extremely difficult Flying Monkey trail. Narrow, loose and exposed terrain with jumps, unavoidable obstacles, sharp turns and sudden drop-offs. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1101932075">OpenStreetMap way 1101932075</a>.</i>]]></description>
