  <Placemark>
    <name>Cypress Mountain Hardline venue (British Columbia) [event course, no public riding]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>2026 Red Bull Hardline Canada venue above Vancouver's North Shore</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Cypress Mountain is building an invitation-only Hardline course for the first Canadian edition on 17 October 2026. The announced course combines extremely steep and rugged downhill, technical rock gardens, massive gaps and drops exceeding 10 metres.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No public bike uplift or public access to the Hardline course is confirmed. This pin documents the event venue, not a trail visitors can ride. Use established legal North Shore networks for normal riding.<br/><br/><p class="warn">&#9888;&#65039; Red Bull Hardline is an invitation-only professional competition. Do not enter, inspect or ride the construction and race course unless the organizer explicitly permits access.</p>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The inaugural Canadian event is announced for 17 October 2026. This is not a recurring public riding season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Vancouver</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.cypressmountain.com/media-press/red-bull-hardline">official Cypress Mountain announcement</a> and <a href="https://www.redbull.com/gb-en/event-series/red-bull-hardline">Red Bull Hardline series</a>. Event access and course status can change.</i>]]></description>
