  <Placemark>
    <name>Huagal Bike Park (Oxapampa, Peru) [booking required]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Boutique gravity park in the Oxapampa cloud forest</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Purpose-built family and progression terrain for downhill, enduro, cross-country and e-MTB around the Casa Huagal mountain lodge. Colombian Tacky builders designed the network to use the steep high-jungle terrain, with beginner options alongside technical forest riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No public lift or walk-up day price is published. Contact Huagal before travelling to reserve riding, accommodation and any available local transport.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January with no published seasonal closure; heavy tropical rain can close or damage trails.<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated daylight operating window; booking and operator confirmation are required.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Oxapampa</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.huagal.pe/bike-park/">official bike-park page</a> and <a href="https://www.huagal.pe/">Casa Huagal</a>. Confirm access, price and trail status directly.</i>]]></description>
