  <Placemark>
    <name>Quito TeleferiQo / Cruz Loma (Ecuador) [gondola DH, from 5.25 USD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>High-altitude gondola-assisted downhill above Quito</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The TeleferiQo carries bikes from the city to Cruz Loma, where a raw downhill route descends volcanic mountain terrain back toward Quito. The operator explicitly permits downhill cycling but warns riders to respect narrow hiking paths. Altitude, weather and exposure make this a serious natural descent rather than a maintained bike park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>One bike-and-rider ascent is published at 5.25 USD; an unlimited day is 9 USD. Confirm that bike carriage and the descent are open before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January with no published MTB season closure.<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00<br/><small>Conservative daylight estimate; gondola hours, wind closures and bike access vary.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Quito centre</td><td>Taxi / bus</td><td>~20 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://teleferico.com.ec/product/ciclismo-extremo/">official TeleferiQo downhill page</a>. Check weather and live gondola status.</i>]]></description>
