  <Placemark>
    <name>Panteon Bikepark (Guayaquil, Ecuador) [registration required]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Cerro Azul gravity and trail park behind Panteon Metropolitano</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Line 1 is a 1.2 km rock-garden descent with optional jumps and technical features returning to the parking area. Line 2 is a longer 2.8 km classic Cerro Azul trail. The venue also supports XC, trail and enduro-style competition.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No mechanical lift is documented. Register with park staff at Parking 10 before riding; a current public day price is not published.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January with no published seasonal closure.<br/>Daily opening hours: 06:30-17:00<br/><small>Estimated daylight window based on event access; verify ordinary opening days with the park.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Central Guayaquil</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://panteon-bike-park.com/">official park site</a> and <a href="https://guayaquil.gob.ec/apoyo-municipio-vuelven-emociones-carreras-ciclismo-montana/">Guayaquil municipality</a>. Register and confirm trail status before riding.</i>]]></description>
