  <Placemark>
    <name>Borovets Bike Park (Bulgaria) [29 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sitnyakovo Express top 1780 m - Rila Mountains</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>15 professionally built and maintained trails totaling 55+ km on the Rila slopes above Borovets, including Flintstones, Simpsons, Forrest Gump, Machete, Harry Potter, Jumanji, Dumbledore, Sun Valley, Mini Air Line, Need For Speed, Tom & Jerry, Scary Movie, Rocky, Air Line and Dirty Dan. An additional 60+ km of shared mountain paths extend the riding into centuries-old forest and scenic highland routes.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Sitnyakovo Express 4-seat chairlift takes riders and bikes to the start zone in ~12 min. 2026 day pass: 29 EUR adult, 24 EUR child/senior; 2 days 48/40 EUR; 3 days 69/59 EUR; season pass 400 EUR. Bike rental and guided DH packages available at Adventure Center Borosport.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 12 June; closed from 28 September (published 2026 season).<br/>Daily opening hours: Fri-Tue 08:30-18:20<br/><small>Closed Wednesdays and Thursdays. Published 2026 hours.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sofia</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Borovets resort</td><td>Bike / walk</td><td>Local</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.borovets-bg.com/bg/aktivnostii/borovec-bajk-park">official Borovets Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://www.borovets-bg.com/bg/liftove/ceni-na-lift-karti-i-bileti">lift pass prices</a>.</i>]]></description>
