  <Placemark>
    <name>Pamporovo Bike Park (Bulgaria) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Snezhanka peak 1925 m - Rhodope Mountains</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A UCI-calendar downhill race track and enduro trails (Elevation 999 race routes) descend from Snezhanka peak through the Rhodope highlands. The park hosts the Pamporovo Bike Fest (12th edition, July 2026, 200+ riders) and a round of the Maxxis BG Downhill Series, confirming serious race-proven terrain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Resort chairlifts serve the DH track during summer events and scheduled operation. Confirm the current bike ticket price and operating calendar before travelling, as published English information is limited.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from September (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; verify the resort lift schedule and event calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Plovdiv</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Pamporovo resort</td><td>Bike / walk</td><td>Local</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://pamporovo.me">Pamporovo resort</a> and <a href="https://mtb-bg.com/tag/pamporovo">MTB-BG Pamporovo coverage</a>.</i>]]></description>
