  <Placemark>
    <name>Jasna Bike Park (Slovakia) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>New gondola-served park below Chopok</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Biela Put to Priehyba gondola serves the designated bike-park terrain in Demanovska Valley. Use only the signed bike lines: the operator explicitly prohibits downhill riding from the summit of Chopok outside the approved park routes.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Uplift is via the A6 Biela Put-Priehyba gondola. Check Gopass or the resort for the bike ticket price and whether bicycle carriage is active on your date.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 August; closed from 1 October for the announced 2026 opening season.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:00<br/><small>Estimated daily window; wind and commissioning work can affect operation.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Liptovsky Mikulas</td><td>Car / resort bus</td><td>~25 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.jasna.sk/en/activities/summer-activities/bike-park">official Jasna Bike Park page</a>. Check the live lift schedule and obey the prohibition on riding down from Chopok.</i>]]></description>
