  <Placemark>
    <name>Myto Ski and Bike Park (Slovakia) [lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Compact gravity park below Dumbier</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A summer bike park with downhill and progressive gravity features on the ski slopes above Myto pod Dumbierom. The venue also hosts a round of the Slovak Downhill Cup, confirming its technical race terrain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The ski-area lift provides uplift when summer bike operations are running. Consult the operator for the current bike ticket and service calendar.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; operation may be concentrated on weekends and events.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Brezno</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.kopeczabavy.sk/en">official Myto Ski and Bike Park</a> and the <a href="https://mytopoddumbierom.sk/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Propozicie-SPDH-2026_Myto-002.pdf">2026 Slovak Downhill Cup race information</a>. Verify public lift days before travel.</i>]]></description>
