  <Placemark>
    <name>Freeride Bikepark Kalnica (Slovakia) [tow lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Slovakia's long-season freeride and race hub</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A dense collection of downhill, enduro, freeride, four-cross, pump-track and slopestyle terrain, including one of Eastern Europe's largest slopestyle courses. BikeFest and national-level gravity events make Kalnica a major Slovak progression and competition venue.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A surface lift serves the gravity hill during scheduled operation; some lines can also be reached by pedalling. Check the park for current tickets and lift days.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 March; closed from 1 November.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>The published season is March through October; daily lift hours vary by date and event.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Nove Mesto nad Vahom</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bratislava</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.bike-parkkalnica.sk/en/kontakt/">official Bikepark Kalnica contact page</a>, <a href="https://slovakia.travel/en/kalnica-bike-park">Slovakia Travel</a> and <a href="https://bikefest.biker.sk/en/info">2026 BikeFest information</a>. Check the park calendar before travelling.</i>]]></description>
