  <Placemark>
    <name>Fatikchhari Enduro Area (Bangladesh) [historic race, access unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hill-country venue of Bangladesh's documented enduro championship</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Fatikchhari Upazila hosted the 2019 Enduro Championship Bangladesh, documenting genuine timed enduro riding in the forested hills north of Chattogram. Public sources do not preserve a dependable permanent course map, trailhead or current maintenance status, so this pin marks the wider event area rather than a signed trail network.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift, permanent shuttle or public trail fee is documented. Contact the Bangladesh Cycling Federation or an active local MTB group for a current legal route, land permission, transport and a precise meeting point before travelling.<br/><br/><p class="warn">&#9888;&#65039; Do not treat the approximate pin as a trailhead. Land access, border-area rules and forest permissions can change, and old race stages may cross private or community land.</p>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 November; closed from 1 May (conservative drier-season indication).<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight only<br/><small>There is no verified current operating season. Monsoon rain, flooding, heat and landslides can make hill tracks unsafe.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Chattogram</td><td>Local guide / car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.webscorer.com/race?raceid=171095">2019 Enduro Championship result and location</a>, <a href="https://www.prothomalo.com/lifestyle/%E0%A6%B8%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%87%E0%A6%95%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%B2%E0%A7%87-%E0%A6%9A%E0%A7%9C%E0%A7%87-%E0%A6%AA%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%B9%E0%A6%BE%E0%A7%9C%E0%A7%87-%E0%A6%AA%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%B9%E0%A6%BE%E0%A7%9C%E0%A7%87">contemporary event coverage</a> and the <a href="https://cyclingfederation.bd/">Bangladesh Cycling Federation</a>. Verify all access locally.</i>]]></description>
