  <Placemark>
    <name>Mt Buller Bike Park (Victoria, AU) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Mt Buller - Victoria's lift-served alpine gravity park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A network of downhill and enduro trails descending from the alpine village at 1600 m through snow gum forest. Purpose-built flow lines and technical black descents make use of the ski-area chairlift infrastructure during the green summer months.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift access for bikes during summer operation. Confirm the current bike ticket, lift schedule and trail status with Mt Buller before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from December; closed from March (southern hemisphere summer).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Melbourne</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.mtbuller.com.au/summer/bike/">Mt Buller</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
