  <Placemark>
    <name>Geilo Bike Park (Norway) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Geilo - lift-served riding between Oslo and Bergen</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A growing bike park in the Hallingdal valley with chairlift-served downhill and flow trails through mountain birch forest. Trail progression from green to black, with the ski resort's natural terrain providing long descents.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift carries bikes during summer operation. Check the current bike ticket with Geilo Sommer before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Oslo</td><td>Train</td><td>~3h30</td></tr><tr><td>Bergen</td><td>Train</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.geilo.com/en/sommer/bike-park">Geilo</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
