  <Placemark>
    <name>Ruka Bike Park (Finland) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ruka - Lapland's largest lift-served bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Finland's premier gravity destination with gondola-served downhill and enduro trails through Lapland's fell landscape. The long summer days above the Arctic Circle mean riding until late evening in June and July, and the rock-and-root terrain is distinctively Finnish.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Ruka gondola carries bikes during the summer season. Confirm the current bike pass and lift schedule with Ruka before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-19:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kuusamo airport</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Oulu</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.ruka.fi/en/summer/bike-park">Ruka</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
