  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Semmering (Austria) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Semmering - Vienna's closest lift-served bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The closest gravity park to Vienna, about one hour away, with chairlift-served downhill and flow trails through the Wiener Alpen. A compact but well-maintained network of lines including a green beginner trail, blue and red flow, and a technical black DH run.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Hirschenkogel chairlift carries bikes during summer operation. Check the current bike ticket with Bikepark Semmering before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Vienna</td><td>Train / car</td><td>~1h</td></tr><tr><td>Graz</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bike-park-semmering.at/">Bikepark Semmering</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
