  <Placemark>
    <name>La Pinilla Bike Park (Segovia, ES) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>La Pinilla - Madrid's closest lift-served bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The nearest commercial bike park to Madrid, about an hour from the capital, with chairlift-served downhill and enduro trails through pine forest. A compact park with a progressive trail network suited to day trips and skills development.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift carries bikes during summer operation. Check the current bike ticket with La Pinilla before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from September (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
