  <Placemark>
    <name>Vall de Nuria Bike Park (Catalonia, ES) [rack railway]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vall de Nuria 1964 m - car-free Pyrenean bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A car-free high-mountain bike park reached only by rack railway, with lift-served downhill and enduro trails in a glacial valley at nearly 2000 m. The rack railway and chairlift provide uplift, making this one of Spain's more unique MTB destinations.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The rack railway from Ribes de Freser carries bikes to the valley. A chairlift within the resort provides additional uplift. Confirm bike carriage and the current tariff with Vall de Nuria before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Barcelona</td><td>Train + rack railway</td><td>~3h</td></tr><tr><td>Ribes de Freser</td><td>Rack railway</td><td>~40 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.valldenuria.cat/en/summer/bike-park/">Vall de Nuria</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
