    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kicking Horse Mountain Resort - world-class Canadian gravity</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One of Canada's premier lift-served parks with the Golden Eagle Express gondola providing uplift from 1185 m to 2345 m. Ninety-plus trails span the full range from green flow to pro-line double-black technical descents, with 1200 m of vertical per lap. The resort also houses a grizzly bear refuge.<br/><br/>
