    <description><![CDATA[<b>Revelstoke Mountain Resort - one of Canada's biggest vertical drops</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The longest vertical descent of any bike park in Canada at over 1700 m with the gondola and chairlift serving upper and lower mountain terrain. Fifty-plus kilometres of trail ranging from machine-built flow to steep, rooty natural black diamond lines through old-growth cedar forest.<br/><br/>
