  <Placemark>
    <name>Skyline Rotorua Bike Park (New Zealand) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Skyline Rotorua - gondola-served gravity above the Whakarewarewa forest</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A purpose-built gondola-served park above Rotorua's world-famous Whakarewarewa redwood forest, with downhill, flow and jump lines from beginner through pro. The park is a major draw of Crankworx Rotorua and is surrounded by one of the Southern Hemisphere's most extensive trail networks.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Skyline gondola carries bikes to the top. Day passes and multi-ride tickets available. Check the current pricing and schedule with Skyline Rotorua before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round, best September-May outside the main wet season.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Rotorua centre</td><td>Bike / car</td><td>~5 min</td></tr><tr><td>Auckland</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.skyline.co.nz/en/rotorua/things-to-do/mountain-bike-park/">Skyline Rotorua</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
