  <Placemark>
    <name>Trailpark Hochjoch - Silvretta Montafon (Vorarlberg, AT) [41.50 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kapell 1850 m - top of the Hochjoch Bahn</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three hand-built flow trails, close to seven kilometres of them, dropping about 500 m from the Kapell restaurant at 1850 m to the mid-station at Gasthaus Kropfen. Hubertus is the long, forgiving one at just over 4 km and the right first lap; Wolfsgruaba and Kilka Wald step up the speed and the technical content without ever turning into a downhill track. No black lines and no bike-park jumps - this is a flow trail park, and a very good one.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Bike carriage on the Hochjoch Bahn only, from Schruns. The summer day ticket is 41.50 EUR (two-day 83 EUR); single-ride tickets exist if you only want one lap, and multi-day, season and annual ticket holders add a bike-transport option instead.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 12 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:30<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr><tr><td>Bregenz</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.silvretta-montafon.at/en/activities/mountain-biking/trailpark-hochjoch">Silvretta Montafon</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
