  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Brandnertal (Vorarlberg, AT) [58 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Loischkopf 1780 m - top of the Loischkopfbahn</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 30 km of trail spread across the Loischkopf and Tschengla side of the Brandnertal, and one of the best-built parks in western Austria. Family flow lines, long red jump trails and proper technical downhill, with the two lower-mountain trails - Tschengla Unchained (blue) and Tschaeck the Ripper (red) - rebuilt from scratch for 2026, plus a new kids' area with its own conveyor in the finish zone. Trails ST04 and ST05 stay shut until 15 June each year to protect a grouse population.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A new 10-seat gondola with bike cabins runs Tschengla to Loischkopf; the Dorfbahn in Brand and the Panoramabahn add terrain. Adult day ticket 58 EUR (junior 47, child 31), four-hour 50 EUR, season 468 EUR or 680 EUR with the Gravity Card. Children born 2020 or later ride free.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 14 May; closed from 1 November (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:45<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr><tr><td>Bregenz</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bike-park-brandnertal.at/">Bikepark Brandnertal</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
