    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Mystic Bike Park - Bright (Victoria, AU) [100 AUD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Mystic Hill 790 m - the top shuttle drop-off</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Over 60 km of trail across 20-plus tracks on the hill directly above Bright, and the centre of gravity riding in the Victorian High Country. Everything from technical natural singletrack to fast gravity flow and big jump lines, with the network dropping around 460 m to town. Bright itself is a genuine mountain-bike town, which makes this an easy place to spend a week.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Elevation Mystic runs the uplift: a one-day Gravity Pass is 100 AUD for unlimited shuttles to several drop zones, and every rider also needs a Mountain Pass (1-day, 7-day or annual) on top. Book ahead - it sells out even off-peak, and walk-ins pay a 5 AUD surcharge.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open all year. Uplift 09:30-16:00 in autumn, winter and spring; 08:00-14:30 in summer to dodge the heat.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-16:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Melbourne</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h30</td></tr><tr><td>Albury</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.elevationmystic.com/pass-options/gravity-pass/">Elevation Mystic</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
