  <Placemark>
    <name>Ischgl / Silvretta Bike Arena (Tyrol) [42 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Idalp 2315 m - top of the Silvrettabahn</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Silvretta Bike Arena Ischgl/Samnaun is a major commercial lift-served gravity area with around 100 km of marked trails, from easy flow lines to technical high-alpine descents. Notable runs include the Velill Trail, Zeblastrail, Schmuggler Trail, Flimjoch Trail and Greitspitz Grat Trail. The arena links Ischgl in Austria with Samnaun in Switzerland and is part of the Gravity Card network. Trail grades range from blue (easy) through red (intermediate) to black (expert).<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The main uplift is the Silvrettabahn gondola from Ischgl village to Idalp. The Fimbabahn runs parallel from a nearby valley station, and the Flimjochbahn continues from Idalp to Viderjoch for the cross-border and higher trails. Bike transport is permitted on all operating gondolas and chairlifts. The 2026 adult "Bike Unlimited" day pass is EUR 42.00; the Smuggler Ticket biker unlimited (cross-border) is EUR 60.50.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 27 June; closed from 4 October (published 2026 dates for Ischgl village lifts).<br/>Daily operating hours: 08:30-17:00 (Silvrettabahn/Fimbabahn); Flimjochbahn and linked Samnaun lifts run until 11 October 2026, 09:00-16:00.<br/><small>Lift schedules vary through the season; check the current timetable before travelling.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Landeck-Zams</td><td>Train + bus 260</td><td>~1 h to Ischgl</td></tr><tr><td>Innsbruck</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h 30</td></tr><tr><td>Innsbruck Airport</td><td>Bus/train to Landeck-Zams, then bus 260</td><td>~2 h 30</td></tr><tr><td>Zurich / Munich</td><td>Car</td><td>~2 h 30-3 h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.ischgl.com/en/summer/silvretta-bike-arena">Ischgl Silvretta Bike Arena</a>, <a href="https://www.ischgl.com/en/summer/summer-cable-car">Ischgl summer cable cars and prices</a>, <a href="https://www.ischgl.com/en/plan-your-trip/arrival-mobility">Ischgl arrival and mobility</a> and the <a href="https://issuu.com/ischgl.com/docs/_e-_mtb_trails">official trail map</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
