  <Placemark>
    <name>Bansko Bike Park (Pirin Mountains) [40 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Banderishka Polyana 1600 m - top of the Bansko gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Bulgaria's largest commercial bike park, on the north side of Pirin National Park. The mapped OSM lines around Banderishka Polyana are unnamed in OpenStreetMap but cover a mix of downhill/enduro terrain: roughly grade 2 (intermediate flow), grade 3 (advanced/rough), and grade 4 (expert). The resort also publishes guided e-bike/enduro tours in the wider Pirin area (Vihren hut, Banya, Dobrinishte, Dancing Bears Park). Trail signage on the ground should be followed; OSM lines are indicative only.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Main uplift is the Bansko gondola from the village to Banderishka Polyana. The downhill day pass (covers gondola + bike transport) is 40 EUR adult / 38 EUR students and retirees / 32 EUR child 7-11. A one-way gondola ticket with bicycle is 30 EUR adult. Banderitsa 1 and 2 chairlifts can be used for higher laps with a separate one-way ticket (24 EUR adult) and run by advance request for groups over 40.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 27 June; closed from 7 September (published 2026 dates: 27 June - 6 September inclusive).<br/>Daily opening hours: gondola 08:30-17:00; chairlifts 08:45-16:15<br/><small>Operator reserves the right to adjust dates and prices.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sofia</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~2h15 (150 km)</td></tr><tr><td>Thessaloniki</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h (220 km)</td></tr><tr><td>Istanbul</td><td>Car</td><td>~6-7h (600 km)</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.banskoski.com/en/page/summer-attractions">Banskoski summer attractions and prices</a> and <a href="https://www.banskoski.com/en/page/lifts-and-ski-slopes">Banskoski lifts and slopes</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
