  <Placemark>
    <name>Krvavec Bike Park (Slovenia) [31 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Krvavec 1490 m - top of the Krvavec cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Six marked trails, roughly 30 km in total, with the largest elevation difference among Slovenian bike parks. Rock'n'Flow is the long signature descent; Muci, Bambino, Panorama and Jezerca give a spread from beginner to advanced. The park is part of the GravityCard network.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Krvavec cable car lifts from the valley to the bike-park base; the bike-park pass also covers the Tiha dolina 4-seater chairlift for mid-mountain laps. Adult day pass 31 EUR, youth (15-18.99) 28 EUR, children (6-14.99) 21 EUR; 3-hour pass 27 EUR; single ride 16 EUR. Season pass 300 EUR adult.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 22 July; closed from 1 October (published main season 22 July - 31 August with off-season weekends/holidays through 30 September; hours vary, verify before travel).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-18:00 typical main season; check operator schedule<br/><small>Cable car and Tiha dolina chairlift operate on a restricted weekday/weekend pattern.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ljubljana</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Kranj</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Brnik airport</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.rtc-krvavec.si/bike-park-krvavec-en">RTC Krvavec bike park</a>, <a href="https://www.rtc-krvavec.si/price-list-schedule">prices and schedule</a>, <a href="https://www.rtc-krvavec.si/where-are-we">location</a> and <a href="https://www.visitkranj.com/en/active-vacation/krvavec-bike-park/">Visit Kranj</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
