  <Placemark>
    <name>Leuk / Illalpe - Meretsch [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Illalpe / Meretsch natural enduro area</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Natural, technical descents on the sunny slopes above Leuk, including the 5.9 km Main descent, the 1.6 km Meretschytrail and a 1.2 km grade-5 Expert descent. These are separate mountain paths rather than a lift-served bike park; plan a pedal-up ride or arrange a local shuttle, and check access, conditions and trail-sharing rules before riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No documented bike lift. Pedal or arrange a local shuttle. Free trail access where permitted.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 May; closed from 01 November (typical snow-free window; verify local conditions).<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Leuk</td><td>Car / bike</td><td>Local access</td></tr><tr><td>Susten</td><td>Train + bike</td><td>Local access</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.leuk.swiss/it/erleben-entdecken/aktivitaeten/bike-und-radfahren/">Leuk Tourism MTB information</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/119493414">OSM Main descent</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/971764463">OSM Meretschytrail</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/621597600">OSM Expert descent</a>. Prices, access, trail status and local rules can change; verify before riding.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
