  <Placemark>
    <name>Ovronnaz (Jorasse) [26 CHF / Magic Pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Jorasse 1940 m - top of the Jorasse chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Ovronnaz is a Magic Pass destination above the Rhone valley. From the Jorasse chairlift top, natural singletrack and gravel descend back toward the village and neighbouring valleys - long, remote all-mountain terrain rather than a groomed bike park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift day pass 26 CHF adult. Magic Pass holders ride free.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 20 June; closed from 25 October (published 2026 dates, plus a pre-opening weekend 13-14 June).<br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.ovronnaz.ch/horaires-tarifs-ete/">Ovronnaz</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
