  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park KRB (Hidalgo) [290 MXN]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bottom shuttle base and parking 2,650 m</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Dense pine-forest bike park in Mineral del Chico, Hidalgo, holding 15 distinct routes tailored specifically for intermediate to advanced Enduro and Downhill progression. The landscape is incredibly steep and chunky, packed with wooden bridges, high-speed drops and tight natural rock gardens. A serious destination for technical riding in scenic sierra terrain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Vehicular shuttle trucks. Standard Sunday group shuttle approximately 290 MXN including pass and shuttle; confirm current pricing. On-site cabin lodging available.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/>
    <small>Published operating hours; shuttle schedules may vary. Confirm group shuttle days and reservation requirements.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access">
      <tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Mexico City</td><td>Car</td><td>~2 h 30</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Pachuca</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h</td></tr>
    </table><br/>
    <i>Sources: park shuttle operator information and regional trail network documentation. Prices, schedules, trail status and shuttle availability can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-98.7185,20.2036,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData>
