  <Placemark>
    <name>Meteoro Bike Park (Querétaro) [40 MXN parking]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Main parking and trailhead base 1,850 m</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Prominent regional MTB hub heavily supported by the local mountain-bike community and the Sonic's MTB team. Features over 8 designated tracks ranging from beginner flow to advanced progression lines. The network is highly modular, packed with built-in features including jump progression clinics, wallrides and progressive drop zones. Free access to the trails with a small parking fee.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Pedal-up / self-shuttle access. Entry to the trail network is free; secure vehicle parking at the base approximately 40 MXN.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round.<br/>Daily opening hours: 07:00-20:00<br/>
    <small>Estimated typical hours; trail network is accessible during daylight.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access">
      <tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Querétaro</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Mexico City</td><td>Car</td><td>~2 h 30</td></tr>
    </table><br/>
    <i>Sources: local MTB community reports and regional trail network information. Prices, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-100.4901,20.6277,0</coordinates></Point>
