  <Placemark>
    <name>Águas da Serra Bike Park (Paraná) [20-30 BRL]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>São Luiz do Purunã, Balsa Nova / Campo Largo region</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Located on the private Estância Águas da Serra, this venue is renowned for its technical Downhill (DH) and Enduro terrain. Four main pistas (Pista 1 through Pista 4) deliver steep off-cambers, deep ruts and gullies (valetas), high-speed gap jumps and technical rock features including the iconic Drop do Pedrão. A proven testing ground for serious gravity riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No chairlift or shuttle. Riders push or pedal back to the top. Day pass fee approximately 20-30 BRL.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round, primarily active on weekends and holidays.<br/>Daily opening hours: weekend and holiday hours<br/>
    <small>Typically open weekends and public holidays; confirm access before visiting.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access">
      <tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Curitiba</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Campo Largo</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr>
    </table><br/>
    <i>Sources: Regional MTB community documentation and venue operator information. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
