  <Placemark>
    <name>Canal Aventura Bike Park (Paraná) [20-40 BRL]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Atlantic Forest riding at the Serra do Mar foothills</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Set in the dense Atlantic Forest near Curitiba, this park features trails named after regional wildlife: Jaguarundi, Macaco Prego, Urubu-rei and Graxaim. The terrain blends flow sections with technical challenges including mud, wet roots, off-camber chutes, small gap jumps and wooden bridge crossings. Best during the drier months from April through October.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No mechanical lift. Ascent is accomplished by pedaling or pushing up the climbing routes. Occasional shuttles organized for special race events. Standard day-use entry approximately 20-40 BRL.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round, best conditions from April through October.<br/>Daily opening hours: weekends and holidays<br/>
    <small>Typically open weekends and holidays; drier season (April-October) offers best trail conditions.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access">
      <tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Curitiba</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Piraquara</td><td>Car / bike</td><td>~10 min</td></tr>
    </table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="http://canalaventura.com.br/">Canal Aventura</a> and regional MTB documentation. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
