  <Placemark>
    <name>Vista Alegre Bike Park (Curitiba) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Urban downhill and freeride in Vista Alegre / Pilarzinho neighborhood</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>An urban gravity spot inside Curitiba city limits. Features shorter, fast-paced downhill tracks including Pista do Parque, Pista da Cachoeira and Perfume de Gardênio. Routes start near the São José church and descend toward the park's waterfall area, built with berms, rollers, small gap jumps and tight tree-lined singletrack. A local favorite for quick sessions.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift or shuttle. Requires pedaling or pushing back to the top. Free access (public city park trails).<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round (public access area).<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/>
    <small>Public park trails; respect local regulations and trail closures.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access">
      <tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Curitiba downtown</td><td>Bike</td><td>~20 min</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Curitiba</td><td>Public transport + bike</td><td>~30 min</td></tr>
    </table><br/>
    <i>Sources: Local MTB community documentation and Curitiba municipal trail information. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
