    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Martigny: Le Planard</name>
    <description><![CDATA[27 km intermediate MTB loop with about 1,065 m of climbing. It climbs Mont Chemin through Chemin-Dessous to the Col des Planches, crosses the Planard pasture, descends towards Charrat and returns to Martigny along the shared Bisse du Guercet. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.martigny.com/fr/activity/le-planard-vtt-44920/">Martigny Tourism</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Martigny Tourism, simplified to 15 m.</i>]]></description>
