  <Placemark>
    <name>Martigny: Tour de la Vallee du Trient</name>
    <description><![CDATA[40.5 km difficult MTB loop with about 1,705 m of climbing. A demanding full tour from Martigny through Vernayaz, the Trient valley, Les Marecottes, Le Tretien, Finhaut and the Col de la Forclaz before the long return to Martigny. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.martigny.com/fr/activity/tour-de-la-vallee-du-trient-vtt-44848/">Martigny Tourism</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Martigny Tourism, simplified to 15 m.</i>]]></description>
